   PrintFormat("決済条件成立解析 time=%s type=%s price=%.5f Stochastic=%s RangeBB=%s TrendSuperTrend=%s TrendBB中央線=%s reason=%s M1確定足=%s StochK=%.3f StochD=%.3f BB上=%.5f BB中=%.5f BB下=%.5f SuperTrend=%.5f SuperTrend方向=%s",
               TimeToString(TimeCurrent(), TIME_DATE | TIME_SECONDS), isBuy ? "BUY" : "SELL", currentPrice,
